# Answer keys are teacher-only. They live in the school Google Drive, not here.
# This repo is PUBLIC — a student can clone it and read every key.
# Pattern is deliberate: a key in ANY unit folder is ignored.
*-Answer-Key.md
*-Answer-Key-*.md
*-Answer-Sheet.md
*-ANSWER-KEY.md

# Anything under a Worksheets/ folder that is not student-facing.
**/Worksheets/*-Key.md
**/Worksheets/*-Key-*.md

# Teacher-only material
*-Teacher-Talking-Points.md
*-Fix-Guide.md
*-TALKING-POINTS.md
*-FIX-GUIDE.md
